WEBVTT

0
00:00:04.280 --> 00:00:07.139
Welcome to the Cisco IT/OT Convergence course.

1
00:00:07.849 --> 00:00:09.119
This is an interactive,

2
00:00:09.130 --> 00:00:10.949
self-paced learning experience.

3
00:00:11.329 --> 00:00:13.609
The course begins with a landing page where you can

4
00:00:13.609 --> 00:00:16.709
scroll to read a course description and view the outline.

5
00:00:17.170 --> 00:00:19.209
Your progress is automatically saved,

6
00:00:19.329 --> 00:00:22.030
so you can pick up where you left off at any time.

7
00:00:22.530 --> 00:00:24.000
As you move through the lessons,

8
00:00:24.090 --> 00:00:26.889
each page will load dynamically as you scroll.

9
00:00:27.209 --> 00:00:28.850
As you complete a page or section,

10
00:00:28.969 --> 00:00:32.430
you will encounter a continue button that guides you forward.

11
00:00:32.849 --> 00:00:34.060
On the left side of the screen,

12
00:00:34.209 --> 00:00:37.290
you'll see a navigation menu showing the full course structure.

13
00:00:37.849 --> 00:00:39.380
As you complete each page,

14
00:00:39.439 --> 00:00:41.250
it will be marked as complete.

15
00:00:41.580 --> 00:00:44.560
Each block of text is accompanied by an audio guide.

16
00:00:44.740 --> 00:00:46.840
You can choose to read or listen.

17
00:00:47.259 --> 00:00:50.259
The audio button in the bottom right opens a menu where you

18
00:00:50.259 --> 00:00:54.810
can toggle the autoplay function on or off and adjust the volume.

19
00:00:55.169 --> 00:00:56.040
Throughout the course,

20
00:00:56.220 --> 00:00:58.639
you'll encounter many interactive activities.

21
00:00:59.099 --> 00:01:02.819
Be sure to select each part of the interaction to view all the information.

22
00:01:03.389 --> 00:01:06.459
You'll also encounter short knowledge checks along the way.

23
00:01:06.830 --> 00:01:10.889
These are designed to help reinforce your understanding and review key points.

24
00:01:11.269 --> 00:01:14.449
You must successfully complete each question to move on.

25
00:01:14.830 --> 00:01:16.220
If you answer incorrectly,

26
00:01:16.349 --> 00:01:19.010
you will receive corrective feedback and can try again.

27
00:01:19.860 --> 00:01:21.260
This course will help you build

28
00:01:21.260 --> 00:01:24.819
foundational knowledge of IT/OT converged environments,

29
00:01:25.099 --> 00:01:28.379
while gaining hands-on experience with Cisco Cyber Vision.

30
00:01:29.040 --> 00:01:29.760
When you're ready,

31
00:01:30.040 --> 00:01:30.980
let's get started.
